  "title": "Data for Canada - Foundation Data Packages",
  "description": "Standardized foundation geospatial data packages for Canada derived from Statistics Canada sources, comprising three temporal snapshots of the National Address Register (June 2024, December 2024, July 2025) and the 2021 Road Network File. Each address record is enriched with a full hierarchy of StatCan geographic identifiers spanning country, province, census division, CSD, CMA, dissemination area, and dissemination block.",
